---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About | BearingCalculators" description="About BearingCalculators.com — free ISO 281 bearing life, interchange, and fit tools for procurement engineers.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-6">About BearingCalculators</h1>
    <div class="prose space-y-4 text-theme-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <p>BearingCalculators.com provides free, browser-based tools for bearing selection, life calculation, brand interchange, and fit analysis. Our target audience is procurement engineers, maintenance teams, and mechanical designers who need quick, accurate reference data.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-theme-primary mt-6">What We Cover</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
        <li>ISO 281 L10 bearing life calculation for ball and roller bearings</li>
        <li>Brand cross-reference: SKF, FAG, NSK, NTN, KOYO, NACHI, Timken</li>
        <li>Chinese manufacturer alternatives: C&U, ZWZ, LYC (Luoyang), HRB (Harbin)</li>
        <li>ISO 286-1:2010 shaft and housing tolerance analysis</li>
        <li>ISO 15:2017 dimensional data for 6200/6300/6000 series DGBB</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-theme-primary mt-6">Data Sources</h2>
      <p>Dimensional data is sourced from ISO 15:2017 and verified against SKF General Catalogue, NSK Product Guide, FAG Bearing Catalogue, and NTN General Catalogue. Load ratings are from manufacturer published data.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-theme-primary mt-6">Contact</h2>
      <p>For inquiries, corrections, or quotation requests, use our <a href="/request-a-quote/" class="accent-text hover:underline">Request a Quote</a> form.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
